24p0/0x0/100/none/fd19ef3f45fbc1baf65522e8fe02675e/2025-01/9de5e94d-48a5-49fa-b68f-61aea770982a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"晚上刮起大風時，林峯又為妻女披上披肩保暖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fae16d255563aeb99bed9e04b535be8c/2025-01/679467fb-dd40-41b3-958e-c982b6a667a1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"他們走到喜洲鎮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d40a78a68a73dfc1a09f779e97c80c55/2025-01/f5d8e547-9ec6-43b2-b64b-bc32a4459b97.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林峯看到張馨月的褲腳太長，與女兒一起踎街為張韾月摺好褲腳，以免太太絆倒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cb07406630a9425518e1d671c1a7ded/2025-01/f42e9e11-0cda-41f3-b5aa-0bbf15111445.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不少網民羨慕張馨月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d5d417770f6d616e9d32048a3f4a9b8/2025-01/de6f5da3-6119-4e09-b6a9-c866359e86bc.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林峯在當地租了開蓬車，為妻女當司機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81b8b405f64593fac32b0ab136c0354a/2025-01/07bbc2a6-b13a-4e1c-8ffd-817cdcb93b20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民認為林峯女兒格格似足爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af377c8db08cc116fa68b045e87b4560/2025-01/10cff8e5-7e7d-4b84-adac-5503b88cb524.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林峯絕對是愛妻號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2094b80f9d3748f8779cee336344b9f7/2025-01/db8e7e10-ba9d-415f-a681-33f516f2c8a0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-04T11:59:47.692666+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":696,"images":77,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}